    <statement><p>Evaluate the expression <m>\displaystyle{\ 27^{-4/3} }</m>.</p>
<p>Your answer must be an exact integer or rational number, not a decimal or algebraic expression.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{27^{-4/3}}</m> = <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>{\frac{1}{81}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p><m>\displaystyle{27^{-4/3} = \frac{1}{27^{4/3}} = \frac{1}{\big(3^3\big)^{4/3}} = \frac{1}{3^{(3\times 4/3)}} = \frac{1}{3^4}= {{\frac{1}{81}}}}</m></p>
</solution>
